        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe nakatangila, ekumona! Mu diulu diakadi ha mutu ha bakeluba muakamueneka tshinfuanyi tshia nkuasa wa bukelenge, muikale ne mubidi wa dibue dia saphir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila muntu wakadi muluate bivualu bia lin ne, Buela munkatshi mua nkata idi inyunguluka muinshi mua bakeluba, ûsha bianza biebe tente ne makala a kahia matema adi hankatshi ha bakeluba, wamuangalashe ha mutu ha musoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yeye wakabuelamu ku mesu kuanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabuela muntu eu, bakeluba bakadi bimana ku luseke lua nsubu lua ku tshianza tshia balume, ne ditutu diakusha tshiendelu tshia munda mua nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua butumbi bua Yehowa buakumuka ku mitu kua bakeluba, buakaya ku mbelu kua nsubu; nsubu wakula tente ne ditutu, ne tshiendelu tshiakula tente ne dinkenke dia butumbi bua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiona tshia mahuahua a bakeluba tshiakunvuibua tô ne ku tshiendelu tshia ha mbelu ha nsubu, tshikale tshikole bu dî dia Nzambi Mutambe Bukole hakuleye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakambileye muntu wakadi muluate tshivualu tshia lin ne, Angata kahia kakuabo ka munkatshi mua nkata idi inyunguluka, ku muaba wa hankatshi ha bakeluba, muntu eu wakabuelamu, wakimana hehi ne nkata mukuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukeluba mukuabo wakolola tshianza tshiandi ku kahia kakadi hankatshi ha bakeluba bakuabo, wakangata dikala diaku, wakaditeka mu bianza bia muntu wakadi muluate tshivualu tshia lin, ne yeye wakadiangata, wakaluhuka nʼadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munkatshi mua bakeluba muakamueneka tshinfuanyi tshia tshianza tshia muntu muinshi mua mahuahua abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatangila kabidi, ekumona! Nkata inai yakadiku hehi ne bakeluba, nkata umue hehi ne mukeluba umue, nkata mukuabo hehi ne mukeluba mukuabo; nkata yakadi ne mubidi bu wa dibue dia chrysolithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkata yonso inai yakadi ne tshinfuanyi tshimue, bu mudi nkata umue muikale munda mua mukuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakayayi, yakaya mu nshila yonso kuakatangila nseke yai inai, kayakatshunguluka hakayayi, hualu bua yakayila mu nshila kuakatangishayi mpala yai; kayakanyunguluka hakayayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mibidi mijima ya bakeluba banai, nyima yabo, bianza biabo, ne mahuahua abo ne nkata kabidi muomumue, biakadi biule tente ne mesu ku nseke yonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunvua babikila nkata ai ne, Nkata idi inyunguluka bu nvunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukeluba yonso wakadi ne mpala inai: mpala wa kumudilu wakadi mpala wa mukeluba mene, muibidi wakadi wa muntu, muisatu wakadi wa nyama wa ntambue ne muinai wakadi wa nyunyu wa mukanku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakeluba bakabanda mulu. Bakadi bifukibue bidi ne muoyo binakamona ku muelelu wa musulu wa Kebâ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaya bakeluba, nkata yakaya nʼabo diatshimue; ne hakolola bakeluba mahuahua abo bua kubuka ha buloba, nkata kayakumuka ku miaba yai ya hehi nʼabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakimanabo, nkata ai yakimana kabidi; hakabandabo mulu, nkata ai yakabanda nʼabo; bualu bua nyuma wa bifukibue wakadi munda muai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Butumbi bua Yehowa buakumuka ku mbelu kua nsubu, buakimana ha mitu ha bakeluba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakeluba bakolola mahuahua abo, bakabuka ha buloba, bakabanda mulu ku mesu kuanyi, ne nkata yakashala hehi nʼabo hakayabo nunku. Bakimana ku tshibi tshia nsubu wa Yehowa tshia ku luseke lua esete; butumbi bua Nzambi wa Isalele buakadi ba mitu habo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi biakadi bifukihue bidi ne muoyo binakamona muinshi mua Nzambi wa Isalele ku muelelu wa musulu wa Kebâ; nakamanya ne badi bakeluba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukeluba yonso wakadi ne mpala inai ne mahuahua anai; ne muinshi mua mahuahua abo muakadi tshinfuanyi tshia bianza bia muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eu mmuanda wa binfuanyi bia mpala yabo: biakadi mpala inakamona ku muelelu wa musulu wa Kebâ; buonso buabo bakaya ku mpala mu nshila mululame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
